id: ops-kw02
title: Make historical Windows proof evidence available in fresh clones
description: "After merging reviewed repair PR #150 with main, CI run 38116691747 fails on Linux and Windows because test/windows-proof-history.test.ts loads test/windows-consumers.proof.ts from b89fd6f36adf91c9bfc784c7ab643d9ce9cb7eae, a development commit outside branch ancestry. The canonical object cache masks this failure. A fresh single-branch clone of #150 reproduces it. Preserve strict historical source-only proof refusal while replacing unavailable development-history dependencies with portable, provenance-linked evidence. This follow-up does not change reviewed repair behavior."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags: []
