repro_steps: "Clone the feature branch into a fresh repository and run node --test test/windows-proof-history.test.ts; git show b89fd6f36adf91c9bfc784c7ab643d9ce9cb7eae:test/windows-consumers.proof.ts fails."
expected_result: "Native proof controls and the missing-history diagnostic test run in a fresh clone using durable reachable history or reviewed committed fixtures, without skipped controls or weakened assertions."
actual_result: "CI Linux suite: 597 tests, 594 passed, 1 failed, 2 optional skips. Both Windows jobs fail the same historical proof test before native consumer controls. Fresh clone selected test: 0 passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped."
